    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "CBB201427628F5B9",
      "text": "大約１年多前……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_fairyboss_01",
      "hash64": "57E0AC65E5DBDD02",
      "text": "怎麼了？皮拿。[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_02",
      "hash64": "B7C0872A8423728D",
      "text": "真老大找我商量的事，\\n我整理得差不多了。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_honooboss_01",
      "hash64": "4BBED119DE7A8E54",
      "text": "商量？商量什麼了？[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_03",
      "hash64": "B7C0862A842370DA",
      "text": "首先是天星大作戰的事。\\n……還有天星隊的隊規。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_04",
      "hash64": "B7C0812A8423685B",
      "text": "最近夥伴變多了不是嗎？\\n所以我們在討論隊裡需要個規則，\\r\\n就是該有個隊規。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_kakutouboss_01",
      "hash64": "819E7BF70D4A4EA1",
      "text": "哦～！是皮拿你的話，\\n應該會有好主意吧？[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_05",
      "hash64": "B7C0802A842366A8",
      "text": "哪有，這件事讓我壓力超大的。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_06",
      "hash64": "B7C0832A84236BC1",
      "text": "我以前會惹人反感，\\n是因為當時我是學生會長……你們都知道吧？[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_honooboss_02",
      "hash64": "4BBED419DE7A936D",
      "text": "你制定了一堆囉嗦的校規，\\n讓學生們都反感到不行對吧。\\r\\n之後就立刻換其他人當了。[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_dokuboss_01",
      "hash64": "BCA702EC8213097E",
      "text": "在下表示同意……\\n後髮際的頭髮長度最多３公分等等。\\r\\n老實說，真是囉嗦透頂……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_07",
      "hash64": "B7C0822A84236A0E",
      "text": "是吧？\\n所以我根本就不適合去訂什麼隊規。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_fairyboss_02",
      "hash64": "57E0AB65E5DBDB4F",
      "text": "可是啊，平時幾乎都是\\n皮拿在照顧隊員不是嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_kakutouboss_02",
      "hash64": "819E78F70D4A4988",
      "text": "大家都很依靠皮拿，\\n而且都很信賴你。[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_honooboss_03",
      "hash64": "4BBED319DE7A91BA",
      "text": "如果是現在的皮拿想出的隊規，\\n我也覺得遵守倒是無妨。[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_dokuboss_02",
      "hash64": "BCA701EC821307CB",
      "text": "……同意！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_08",
      "hash64": "B7C07D2A8423618F",
      "text": "好啦好啦，我知道了。\\n隊規我來訂……我來訂就是了。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_09",
      "hash64": "B7C07C2A84235FDC",
      "text": "能做的事……\\n我已經做得夠多了吧……[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_10",
      "hash64": "B7BCFF2A8420559E",
      "text": "何況這是我自己訂的隊規，\\n我會瀟灑地離開天星隊的。\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳能收下這個老大之證團隊徽章嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_waza_01",
      "hash64": "1BC1335191082461",
      "text": "還有這個超酷的\\n招式學習器也拿去吧。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_11",
      "hash64": "B7BD002A84205751",
      "text": "啊～啊～\\n這麼看來派對也the end了……[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_12",
      "hash64": "B7BCFD2A84205238",
      "text": "話說回來，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的每一隻寶可夢都太猛了吧。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_13",
      "hash64": "B7BCFE2A842053EB",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳那是在學院裡學的嗎？\\n讓寶可夢學會的招式或培育方法之類的。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
