    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "141F4EB4A3D0D70C",
      "text": "好的。\\n我就開門見山地問。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "141F4FB4A3D0D8BF",
      "text": "這樣下去的話，\\n你們所有人都會受到退學處分吧。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "1422DCB4A3D3FE2D",
      "text": "為什麼不解散天星隊，\\n到學院上學呢？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_23",
      "hash64": "B7B9762A841D36FC",
      "text": "你偏要問這個？\\n我們只是在等同伴而已。\\r\\n……雖然不知道這個同伴會不會回來。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "1422DBB4A3D3FC7A",
      "text": "同伴……是很重要的夥伴嗎？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_24",
      "hash64": "B7B9752A841D3549",
      "text": "[EMPTY 62]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "1422DAB4A3D3FAC7",
      "text": "[EMPTY 62]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_25",
      "hash64": "B7B9742A841D3396",
      "text": "這個同伴就是天星隊最強的老大。\\n以訓練家來說，就像是首席冠軍？[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_26",
      "hash64": "B7B9732A841D31E3",
      "text": "這個人邀請大家一起建立天星隊，\\n被稱為真老大。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "1422D9B4A3D3F914",
      "text": "這個真老大，現在人在哪裡？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_27",
      "hash64": "B7B9722A841D3030",
      "text": "我要是知道就不會頭痛了。\\n有一年半左右了吧？想聯絡都聯絡不上。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "1422D8B4A3D3F761",
      "text": "[EMPTY 62]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_28",
      "hash64": "B7B9812A841D49AD",
      "text": "我一直以為只要我不退出天星隊，\\n或許哪一天真老大就會聯絡我了。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_29",
      "hash64": "B7B9802A841D47FA",
      "text": "老師們一直囉嗦著要我退出天星隊，\\n還出現了像你們這樣的傢伙……[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_15",
      "hash64": "1422D7B4A3D3F5AE",
      "text": "…………[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_30",
      "hash64": "B7B5F32A841A228C",
      "text": "反而是我被拋下了嗎……\\n說起來真老大以前就想解散天星隊……[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_16",
      "hash64": "1422D6B4A3D3F3FB",
      "text": "真老大和天星隊\\n真的有那麼重要嗎？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_31",
      "hash64": "B7B5F42A841A243F",
      "text": "那還用說。\\n如果用學院常說的話，就像是……\\r\\n寶物？[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
